Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Covariant Derivatives and Connections in the \[ScriptCapitalU]\
\[ScriptCapitalD] Calculus", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976889187114873*^9, 3.9768892175197353`*^9}, {
  3.977098182469513*^9, 
  3.977098186708535*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e32a3f2a-fb9c-4256-a2ab-\
ff2d5896380e"],

Cell["Brian Beckman", "Author",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5011898003565187`*^9, 3.5011898164415183`*^9}, {
  3.970503905858189*^9, 3.970503938930399*^9}, {3.9705040303289137`*^9, 
  3.970504033015139*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8531c00f-1b9c-4144-b1cc-\
d974e69c32ba"],

Cell["Jan 2026", "Author",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970503954212903*^9, 3.97050395891148*^9}, {
  3.972479129640115*^9, 3.9724791301125593`*^9}, {3.973546918457328*^9, 
  3.973546918968728*^9}, {3.9762809550919313`*^9, 
  3.976280957806756*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"90e60fd9-e338-4487-becf-\
9813ab59ecef"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Glass Box\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] Approach", \
"Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.97688929871796*^9, 3.976889556697713*^9, 3.976889851295733*^9, {
   3.977097211709004*^9, 
   3.977097213201786*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5c85bee8-6fff-4c6e-ba13-\
21ee29fd942b"],

Cell["\<\
In developing the \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] Calculus, we made a \
conscious decision for the time being to implement the engine as a glass-box \
script rather than as a Package, prioritizing transparency over isolation at \
this stage of development. When the toolkit is finalized, \
we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll address encapsulating it in a Package.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.97688929871796*^9, {3.976889563666814*^9, 3.9768895935975227`*^9}, {
   3.9769715522630987`*^9, 3.976971581002223*^9}, 3.9770969722863827`*^9, {
   3.9770970369338617`*^9, 3.977097104142345*^9}, 3.977099003004167*^9, {
   3.9770990471939573`*^9, 
   3.977099055974069*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3ad9d1db-a459-453c-8a0f-\
ab0ff2d3dcce"],

Cell["With a glass box, the reader can:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.97688929871796*^9, {3.976889563666814*^9, 3.9768896868815203`*^9}, {
   3.977097109877501*^9, 
   3.97709711259033*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"33d29148-4fb9-4c6d-b1a1-\
1cb356be3429"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Inspect the machinery: Type ",
 StyleBox["?valence", "Input"],
 " or ",
 StyleBox["?metricRules", "Input"],
 " and immediately see the physics logic, not an opaque symbol."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.97688929871796*^9, {3.976889563666814*^9, 
   3.976889704406357*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"65f78dce-8047-4c0d-b6fa-\
568aac671db2"],

Cell["\<\
Modify the engine: Experiment with new rules without fighting a locked \
namespace.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.97688929871796*^9, {3.976889563666814*^9, 3.97688971686047*^9}, {
   3.977097126266108*^9, 
   3.977097129537039*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ae8a7d07-2d40-4606-a995-\
827006906cad"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Explore derivations: For instance, verify that the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", "\[Mu]", "\[Nu]"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"be2a8e0b-7f8c-4cab-989e-aeee3f8082e1"],
 "\:200b on the screen is the same mathematical object as in the code."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.97688929871796*^9, {3.976889563666814*^9, 3.976889758341415*^9}, {
   3.9770971358421783`*^9, 
   3.9770971582105093`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d65a00ca-c878-477e-af3e-\
c3a97e6d08ae"],

Cell["\<\
Therefore, let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s load The RelativityToolkit directly into \
your notebook context.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.97688929871796*^9, {3.976889563666814*^9, 3.976889759548066*^9}, {
   3.976889789792459*^9, 3.9768898423425837`*^9}, {3.977097167947496*^9, 
   3.977097180953438*^9}, 
   3.977099043316263*^9},ExpressionUUID->"1268bb70-e6fd-453d-aa58-\
a609a84f0acd"]
}, Open  ]],

